At 2nd level, using the Blowgun Lord, your damage is calculate using:
1d4 + Wisdom Modifier of piercing damage.
This die increases to 2d4 at 7th level; This die increases to 3d4 at 15th level;

At 2nd level, using the Bow God, your damage is calculate using:
1d8 + Wisdom modifier of piercing damage.
This die increases to 2d8 at 7th level; This die increases to 3d8 at 15th level;

At 2nd level, using the Tyrant Dagger, your damage is calculate using:
1d6 + Proficiency bonus of piercing damage.
This die increases to 2d6 at 7th level; This die increases to 3d6 at 15th level;
